TypeCasting
Is a process of converting one type of data type or value into another type of data type or value.
It is used when we want to store one datatype into another datatype variable.

Type Casting is Classified into 2 things
1   prinitive typecasting
2   Non-primitive typecasting

1) Primitive Type Casting:
    It is classified into 2 types
    A) Widening (implicitly)
    B) Narrowing (Explicitly)

2) Non-Primitive Type Casting:
   It is classified into 2 types
    A) UpCasting
    B) DownCasting


